  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Install:</strong> Hospital<br>\n<strong>Cost:</strong> 5,000eb<br>\n<strong>Humanity Loss:</strong> 14 (4d6)</p>\n<p>This linear frame can be purchased as either external or internal. In either form, while connected properly to the frame, the user gains a +2 to Stealth checks relating to movement, increases their BODY to 12, and their Melee Ambush Attack Checks by +2. The internal frame requires two installations of Grafted Muscle &amp; Bone Lace. The external frame requires two installations of Interface Plugs and does not affect the user's HP or death saves.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>The +2 to movement Stealth and to Melee Ambush attacks are toggles in the roll dialog.</li>\n<li>The external frame. Sets BODY to 12 while equipped, like the core's Linear Frame β. Requires two installations of Interface Plugs. It does not change HP or Death Saves; adjust those by hand.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From Bontari Homebrew Cyberpunk Items by Bontari (Cyberware).</em></p>"
